  "name": "Quick Escape",
  "type": "feature",
  "system": {
    "attribution": {},
    "description": "<p>When the Ninja has marked 4 of their HP, you can <strong>spend a Fear</strong> to have them drop a smoke bomb at their location. All targets within Very Close range of the Ninja become <em>Dizzied</em>. <em>Dizzied</em> targets have disadvantage on their next action roll, then clear the condition. The Ninja becomes <em>Hidden</em> and immediately moves a Far distance.</p>",
